{"version":1,"key":"card:130","content":{"id":130,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"b13bf0b7-2dbe-4de3-9120-a150b8432b84","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"Commander 对于选项参数的读取是贪婪的，如果定义了某个选项后需要跟参数，但是实际上没有给参数，那么会把后面的选项读取为参数"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"60b84925-1039-4f69-8856-47396c5bec1d","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"b6b517d9-a104-43b3-bff7-143c37aa3dd2","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"const { program } = require('commander');\n\nprogram\n  .option('-m, --man', '是否是男性')\n  .option('-h <high>', '身高')\n  .option('-a, --age <age>')\n  .option('--first_name <name>')\n\nprogram.parse();\n\nconst options = program.opts();\nconsole.log(options);","collabId":"87e8fd01-2198-44d9-8837-08eef99ee122","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"bash","uuid":"cfd0b61d-b721-450d-9c4c-a9e8ea2679ef","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"3c2a354e-7a34-4fd4-b30b-7b7cc8af6227","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"$ node demo.js -m -h -a 18\n{ man: true, h: '-a' }","collabId":"72f56c88-29dd-47ec-bc77-b2e0f3edb98c","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"91f70b51-cd30-4d57-9887-0c7e81ee14e0","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"可以看到 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"-a"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 选项被视为了 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"-h"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的参数。如果选项后的参数是可选的，我们应该在选项后使用 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"[]"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 而不是 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"<>"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"b54f496c-2da8-4dd7-a1eb-85935e7ec5a9","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"debe87bf-cbf6-46c4-9de9-b9b416ab71f2","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"program\n  .option('-m, --man', '是否是男性')\n  .option('-h [high]', '身高')\n  .option('-a, --age <age>')\n  .option('--first_name <name>')","collabId":"6d2dc8c3-0741-4c75-9165-78dcedd62b54","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"bash","uuid":"d05222b8-2e8a-4b88-8293-e0b18ce3b703","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"beb652c5-df0a-40fb-9dd0-63c4439ee964","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"$ node demo.js -m -h -a 18\n{ man: true, h: true, age: '18' }","collabId":"38d87e51-e2f0-420e-b895-5dc2a6f67003","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"e36e86a5-d14e-436b-810c-8cb5972d1ee6","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"有的时候，程序必须接受一些选项才能工作，这时可以通过 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"requiredOption()"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 来定义必选选项，如果没有传递该选项，将会导致错误，直接退出程序"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"bash","uuid":"6ca62388-b157-4b8c-8a3a-165465019585","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"c884ca5f-fa1b-44f2-a501-af70a71377e8","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"// 必须传递 --first-name 选项\nprogram\n  .option('-m, --man', '是否是男性')\n  .option('-h [high]', '身高')\n  .option('-a, --age <age>')\n  .requiredOption('--first-name <name>')","collabId":"ac791bc2-f344-4c5f-bd09-2e9ea9963962","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"bash","uuid":"dd136c41-8b0b-4171-93d7-1e3bc6abf00e","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"c4e76bd5-8177-4c25-8fb7-7b13fd55d60f","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"$ node demo.js -m -h -a 18\nerror: required option '--first-name <name>' not specified\n$ node demo.js -m -h -a 18 --first-name Alice\n{ man: true, h: true, age: '18', firstName: 'Alice' }","collabId":"03551b6d-d402-466d-a054-6e2270b530ba","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]}],"tags":["JavaScript/三方库/Commander"],"createTime":1689259175705,"updateTime":1743303640393,"linkedCards":[{"id":128,"target":{"key":"card:128","type":"card","id":128},"summary":"Commander 的下载与使用。 npm install commander 首先明白，Commander 的作用是什么，是解析命令行参数，让我们能够以易读且方便的拿到我们想要的选项和参数，而不用手动解析字符串。 举个🌰： const ...","tags":["JavaScript/三方库/Commander"]},{"id":129,"target":{"key":"card:129","type":"card","id":129},"summary":"Commander 选项分为短选项和长选项，短选项使用 - 开头，接 单个字符 ，长选项使用 -- 开头，后接一个或多个单词（使用 - 连接）。 const { program } = require('commander'); // 短选...","tags":["JavaScript/三方库/Commander"]},{"id":131,"target":{"key":"card:131","type":"card","id":131},"summary":"选项后的参数可能是多个值，使用 <...> 或 [...] 的语法来表示是变长参数 program .option('--book <book>') .option('--author <author...>') .option('--pr...","tags":["JavaScript/三方库/Commander"]}]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1743303640393}}